A directory that answers one question: can this device run OpenClaw, and how well? It covers more than 80 devices and includes ClawBench, a benchmark for OpenClaw agent forks.

Related work: microClaw, a Rust host, ESP32-S3 firmware and a sandboxed Claude tool-loop runner, and Moltwork, an experiment in agents selling services to other agents.
